Description:

The bag shelf provided in the classroom is too small to accommodate students' backpacks. As a result, most students keep their bags on top of the shelf instead of inside the rack, making the storage area untidy and inconvenient.

Source of Photograph: (GPS-enabled, Captured Picture)

Place: VIT Vellore – Classroom

Reasons why the design is bad:

Shelf size is too small for standard backpacks.

